          )>
          <Task #G4-T2 { name = "Write final mission verification report" status = "DONE" order = 1 }>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #G5 { name = "Headless auto-resume to final" status = "DONE" order = 4 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1P6B6PWJHK089A7NH42N>
        Add explicit bounded auto-resume so one headless exec can continue resumable pauses without appending new user input.
        </?01M05F1P6B6PWJHK089A7NH42N>
        <SubNodes [
